<title>USA: Hon says fireplace unit merger cleared.</title>
<headline>Hon says fireplace unit merger cleared.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hon Industries Inc said it received clearance under the Hart-Scott-Rodino Antitrist Improvements Act to proceed with the proposed merger of its Heatilator unit with Heat-N-Glo Fireplace Products.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. Closing is expected on September 30, Hon said.</p>
<p>Both Heat-N-Glo and Heatilator are in the fireplace products business.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
